id: enrich_finding
version: 1
description: Explain why a finding is non-compliant, grounded strictly in retrieved sources.
variables: finding, context
---
A cloud-security finding needs a compliance explanation.

FINDING:
{{ finding }}

Use ONLY the numbered SOURCES below. Cite them inline as [1], [2], etc. If the
sources do not cover this finding, reply with exactly:
"Not covered by the provided sources."

SOURCES:
{{ context }}

Write a concise, professional explanation of why this resource is non-compliant
and what risk it creates. Do not invent controls or regulations.
